1
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,614
For months, the forest has held its breath.

2
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:11,919
Then, one morning, the sun returns with warmth in it.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,714
And the ice begins to let go.

4
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:23,127
Day by day, the snow draws back from the ground it has kept hidden.

5
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:29,223
The first flowers do not wait for it to leave.

6
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:40,080
Under the soil, a seed has felt the change. All it has saved goes into a single push toward the light.

7
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:46,846
Ferns unroll, each frond packed tight since last year.

8
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:55,233
On the branches, buds made last summer split open, and the wood turns green.

9
00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:02,851
A ladybird that slept through the winter among the dead leaves climbs toward the sun.

10
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:13,868
Then the rain comes. And it is no longer cold.

11
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:19,874
Now even the slowest are on the move.

12
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:30,200
None of this is new. It was all here, under the snow, waiting.

